}

User: Requested a configuration editor modal for categories/subcategories, brands, models, and series, plus customized LLM instructions for every property.

Assistant: Added the Edit configuration modal to the demo. It contains:
- Categories & subcategories editor
- Brands & series editor
- Model regex and allowed-value editor
- Per-property LLM description, instructions, and examples editor
- Save configuration action
- Reset demo config action

The browser sends edited configuration to POST /api/config. The server validates the configuration, rebuilds the active ProductParser, and uses the new configuration for subsequent parses. GET /api/config returns the active configuration.

