https://github.com/ammisaidkaidi/productName_parser.git

The GitHub remote later contained an additional workflow commit. The local changes were rebased on that remote history and pushed successfully.

User: Requested quality values such as 1ch, 3ch, original, and chinoise, and a madein field supporting countries, locale/importation, and country abbreviations such as dz, tn, fr, it, and usa.

Assistant: Added quality values and aliases:
- 1ch
- 3ch
- original
- chinoise
- 1 ch -> 1ch
- 3 ch -> 3ch
