- chinois -> chinoise

Added the madein field and explicit origin parsing for Made in, Origine, Pays, Country, Provenance, locale, importation, and configured country codes:
- dz -> Algérie
- tn -> Tunisie
- fr -> France
- it -> Italie
- usa/us -> USA
- cn/china/chine -> Chine
- local -> locale
- import/importé/importée -> importation

Also fixed an origin regex issue where the word original could be incorrectly read as an origin marker.

